# Canva Ops

Dual-path:
1. **MCP** `https://mcp.canva.com/mcp` — interactive edit/comment/export via Cursor MCP (OAuth required).
2. **Enterprise client** `tools/canva-client` — PKCE, autofill poll, resize, export, registry writer.

Gates: Autofill / Brand Kit write / bulk resize need Pro or Enterprise. Without plan → stay BRIEF-ONLY.

Never commit secrets. Poll jobs 2–5s. User must approve commits of editing transactions.
Default user-facing mode remains BRIEF-ONLY until they say CANVA:ON.
